            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.123</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Trim a recording that has not been transcribed yet: press the scissors, drag the part to keep on the timeline, and only that part is kept and transcribed.</li>
<li>A cancelled or failed transcription no longer sends a &quot;Transcript ready&quot; notification.</li>
<li>The fullscreen video timeline shows before the transcript is ready.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
